abstract: >
  Foundational treatise of the Tecnologia di Controfase series (Ordinative
  Sciences programme). Counter-phase (controfase) is formalized as a universal
  ordinative phase-shift operator: definition at two levels (deliberate act and
  embedded structure), energetic accounting, topology of applicability,
  execution algorithm, five falsifiability criteria, phenomenological
  signature, and application across seven domains, with explicit confidence
  grades (S0-S3). Includes a bilingual (IT/EN) instruction dataset for LoRA
  fine-tuning. Italian native composition.
keywords:
  - controfase
  - counter-phase
  - ordinative sciences
  - technology of expressions
  - reactive systems
  - engram
  - phase-shift operator
  - falsifiability
